sed away too soon—were implicated. Only the records of \"the second daughter Wenxi County Lady Li Wanshun, courtesy name Wangniang, married Liu Yingdao\" and \"eldest daughter Li\" remained in the historical record, nevertheless.\n\nThe Yongning Princess Li Changge, whose parents had an unexplained and perplexing relationship with Li Shimin, emerged in these Li's mysteries. After learning of her mother's suicide and her father's murder following the Xuanwu Gate Incident, Changge fled the palace with bitterness and assumed the identity of a man in order to conceal her identity and bring troops back to Chang'an to exact revenge on her parents."},"tags":[{"name":"Ancient China","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Revenge","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Royal Affairs","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Survival","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Archery","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Orphan","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kingdom Management","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Indigenous Cultures","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Full CGI","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Suicide","rank":60,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"The Legend of Princess Chang-Ge","english":"The Legend of Princess Chang-Ge","native":"长歌行","romaji":"Chang Ge Xing","synonyms":[]},"trailer":{"id":"jN1lfy0_rMk","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jN1lfy0_rMk/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}